WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.612
Welcome to Building the
Daily Checks Workbook.

2
00:00:02.612 --> 00:00:06.812
This is Chapter 1: the daily
checks, and where each one lives.

3
00:00:06.812 --> 00:00:09.308
Before anything is drawn on a dashboard,

4
00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:13.468
each daily check in the operator
runbook gets one row: what it reads,

5
00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:17.099
where else to look, and whether
a workbook can show it at all.

6
00:00:17.099 --> 00:00:21.645
We'll start from what Microsoft Learn
gives you, see what it leaves to you,

7
00:00:21.645 --> 00:00:25.188
read the kit's manifest and its
ten tabs, and walk two labs.

8
00:00:25.188 --> 00:00:27.960
The chapter has been
reviewed and approved,

9
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.490
and the code is illustrative,
tested against fixtures.
